| GET | `/api/roles/v1/role/{id}` | Retrieves a specific role and its permissions. |
| POST | `/api/roles/v1/role/` | Creates a new role; requires the `create_role` permission. |
| PATCH | `/api/roles/v1/role/{id}` | Updates a role's name, description, code, or permissions. |
| DELETE | `/api/roles/v1/role/{id}` | Soft-deletes a role. Permanent deletion is restricted to superusers. |
| POST | `/api/roles/v1/role/{id}/restore` | Restores a soft-deleted role. |
| POST | `/api/roles/v1/role/{role_id}/permissions/{permission_id}` | Adds a permission to a role. |
| DELETE | `/api/roles/v1/role/{role_id}/permissions/{permission_id}` | Removes a permission from a role. |

